{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11106420","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11106420","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1110642001:0":{"text":"소렌, 아, 안돼, 혼자...","source_cn":"索恩，喂，不要，一个人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3D5A89CE78C8009","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1110642002:0":{"text":"소렌, 진정해! 너희가 이곳에 있는 이유를 잘 생각해 봐. 너희 둘이야말로 서로를 강하게 만들어주는 존재라고.","source_cn":"索恩，别冲动！想想你们站在这里的原因吧。你们，才是彼此...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x53D317F965C7AE86","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"소렌, 진정해! 너희가 이곳에 있는 이유를 잘 생각해 봐. 너희 둘이야말로 서로를 강하게 만들어주는 존재라고.","female":"소렌, 진정해! 너희가 이곳에 있는 이유를 잘 생각해 봐. 너희 둘이야말로 서로를 강하게 만들어주는 존재라고.","variant_male_record_index":"122271","variant_female_record_index":"122272","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110642003:0":{"text":"이제 알 것 같아. 우리 둘이 함께한다면 그 누구에게도 지지 않을 거야.","source_cn":"我似乎明白了。只要有我们在彼此身边，我们就不会输给任何人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x161A48A7B7E7A824","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:主角":{"text":"주인공","source":"主角","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}}